---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Affiliate Disclosure"
	description="Transparency and affiliate relationship disclosure for StackVerdict."
	pubDate={new Date('October 01 2026')}
>
	<h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
	<p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>

	<p>
		Transparency is extremely important to us at <strong>StackVerdict</strong>. We believe in being 100% upfront about how this website is funded.
	</p>

	<h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
	<p>
		Some of the links on StackVerdict are "affiliate links." This means that if you click on a link and purchase a paid subscription or product from that software vendor, StackVerdict may earn a small referral commission at <strong>no extra cost to you</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>
		In fact, using our links sometimes provides you with exclusive discounts or extended trial periods negotiated for our readers.
	</p>

	<h2>Editorial Integrity</h2>
	<p>
		Our affiliate relationships do <strong>not</strong> influence our editorial content, software ratings, or product comparisons. We only recommend software, AI models, and tools that we have genuinely tested and believe provide real value to developers.
	</p>
	<p>
		Thank you for supporting StackVerdict by using our links — it allows us to keep publishing high-quality, free guides for the developer community!
	</p>
</Layout>